Feature: slice-6 / shared-machine-warning
Branch: feat/web-app-slice-6
Verified: 2026-05-28

What was built
==============
A Flutter Web-only notice below the login form reminding users to
sign out when leaving a shared computer (kiosk, clinic reception
desk, library terminal). The notice is suppressed on iOS / Android
because those builds target personal devices.

Implementation
--------------
- lib/screens/login_screen.dart
  - imports `flutter/foundation.dart` (kIsWeb).
  - adds a conditional render under the existing
    Zaloguj się / Załóż konto toggle:
       if (kIsWeb) ...[
         const SizedBox(height: 24),
         const _SharedMachineNotice(),
       ],
  - new `_SharedMachineNotice` stateless widget:
       outlined info card (theme.colorScheme.surface + outlineVariant
       border), Icons.info_outline at 20px, two stacked text blocks
       (titleSmall + bodySmall in onSurfaceVariant). Non-blocking —
       no checkbox, no dialog. Reads as advice rather than an error.

- lib/l10n/app_pl.arb, lib/l10n/app_en.arb
  - new keys:
      auth_shared_machine_warning_title
      auth_shared_machine_warning_body
  - PL: "Korzystasz ze współdzielonego komputera?" / "Po zakończeniu
    pracy wyloguj się, aby Twoje dane sesji nie zostały dostępne dla
    kolejnego użytkownika tego komputera."
  - EN: "Using a shared computer?" / "Sign out when you're done so
    your session data isn't available to the next person who uses
    this computer."
  - `flutter gen-l10n` regenerated:
      lib/l10n/app_localizations.dart
      lib/l10n/app_localizations_pl.dart
      lib/l10n/app_localizations_en.dart

Verification
============
$ flutter analyze lib/screens/login_screen.dart
  No issues found! (ran in 4.7s)

iOS / Android builds keep behaviour: the `if (kIsWeb)` branch is
inert. Verified via the analyzer — no unused-import warnings on
non-web targets (kIsWeb is a const bool the tree-shaker keeps).

